  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "I don't think the Rust frontend has equivalent options to `stream_interval`, as it works on the raw output from the engine and has nothing to do with SSE batching. Although it doesn’t bring any noticeable performance improvements in Rust based on my previous benchmarking, I still think we probably want to have this, as it also affects user-facing behavior.",
